  "query_preview": "(Friday through Monday)...\nNot much change in high temperatures is expected through Sunday\nwith high temperatures a few degrees cooler possible on Monday. \nAn increase in moisture and some mid and high clouds for Thursday\nnight will result in low temperatures a few to around 5 degrees\nwarmer than Wednesday night with a corresponding slight increase\nin HeatRisk on Friday. For Friday for the mountains below 6500 \nfeet, inland valleys, and Apple and Lucerne Valleys, the HeatRisk\nwill increase to moderate to locally major with the HeatRisk for \nthe lower deserts increasing to major to locally extreme.\n\nThere is a slight chance of showers and thunderstorms for the\nmountains on Friday afternoon followed by drying for the weekend\ninto early next week.",
